---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import source from '../data/quran-source.json';
---
<BaseLayout title="Privacy & Content Sources" description="How nafisalmuhsin.com handles analytics, contact enquiries, local preferences, and Qur’an content attribution.">
  <header class="page-hero"><div class="orb"></div><div class="container reveal"><p class="eyebrow">Privacy & transparency</p><h1>Clear about what this site keeps—and what it does not.</h1><p class="lead">This website is designed to work without accounts, advertising profiles, or invasive tracking.</p></div></header>
  <article class="narrow policy section-sm">
    <section class="reveal"><h2>At a glance</h2><ul><li>No user accounts or cloud listening profiles.</li><li>No advertising cookies or cross-site tracking.</li><li>Playback preferences stay in your browser.</li><li>Contact details are used only to respond to your enquiry.</li></ul></section>
    <section class="reveal"><h2>Local listening preferences</h2><p>The site stores theme preference, playback speed, recently played Surahs, favourites, and the current playback position in local browser storage. This information remains on your device and can be removed by clearing site data.</p></section>
    <section class="reveal"><h2>Privacy-friendly analytics</h2><p>When configured, Plausible measures aggregate page visits and actions such as recitation plays, completed listens, searches, video plays, outbound links, and successful form submissions. Enquiry contents, names, email addresses, and other personal fields are never sent to analytics.</p></section>
    <section class="reveal"><h2>Contact enquiries</h2><p>Contact submissions are processed by Formspree. The submitted name, email address, enquiry type, date, and message are used only to review and respond to your enquiry. Do not include sensitive personal information.</p></section>
    <section id="quran-data" class="reveal"><h2>Qur’an data and translation</h2><p>The Arabic text is the Uthmani text sourced from {source.arabicSource}. The English translation is {source.translation} by {source.translator}. The checked-in dataset is {source.provider} version {source.version}, licensed under {source.license}. Translation attribution is displayed throughout the reader and the text is protected from browser auto-translation.</p><p>A credentialed Quran Foundation synchronization adapter is included for future dataset refreshes. Any source transition must pass chapter, verse-count, Arabic-presence, translation, uniqueness, and attribution validation before release.</p></section>
    <section class="reveal"><h2>External services</h2><p>Social, video, and charity links open third-party services with their own privacy policies. YouTube videos use privacy-enhanced embeds and are loaded only after you choose to play them. Charity contributions happen only on the selected organisation’s website; this site does not handle funds.</p></section>
    <p class="updated">Last updated: 5 August 2026</p>
  </article>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
  .policy { display: grid; gap: 3rem; }
  .policy section { padding-bottom: 2rem; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line); }
  .policy h2 { font-size: clamp(1.7rem,4vw,2.6rem); }
  .policy p,.policy li { color: var(--ink-soft); }.policy li + li { margin-top: .5rem; }
  .updated { font-size: .78rem; }
</style>
